@startuml
title Sincronizacao offline-first
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor "Usuario" as User
participant "App Flutter" as App
database "Banco local" as LocalDB
participant "API" as API
participant "SyncService" as Sync

User -> App : Criar, editar ou excluir registro
App -> LocalDB : Salvar entidade local
App -> LocalDB : Registrar mutacao pendente

alt Sem internet
  App --> User : Manter item pendente
else Com internet
  App -> LocalDB : Buscar mutacoes pendentes
  App -> API : POST /api/sync { items[] }
  API -> Sync : Processar itens

  note right of Sync
  Ordem oficial de envio:
  property -> lot -> animal -> visit -> event

  Regras do processamento:
  - chave repetida -> REPLAYED
  - item aplicado -> SYNCED
  - conflito -> CONFLICT_SERVER_WINS
  - hard delete -> tombstone quando aplicavel
  end note

  Sync --> API : Resultado dos itens
  API --> App : SyncResponse
  App -> LocalDB : Atualizar status e checkpoint

  App -> API : GET /api/sync/pull?since=checkpoint
  API -> Sync : Buscar atualizacoes

  note right of Sync
  Retorno do pull:
  - serverTime
  - contract
  - properties, lots, animals
  - visits, events
  - deletedRecords
  end note

  Sync --> API : Snapshot incremental
  API --> App : PullSyncResponse
  App -> LocalDB : Reconciliar colecoes
  App -> LocalDB : Aplicar tombstones
  App --> User : Base local sincronizada
end

@enduml
